| `e2e.exempt.<endpoint>` | string | `{}` in keel; the `grpc /thing.v1.ThingService/CreateThing` entry when `transports` includes `grpc` | an endpoint id mapped to a non-blank reason | `tests/integration/test_e2e_coverage.py` | Lets one named endpoint through the gate with no scenario; an entry naming no endpoint, one a scenario already names, or one with a blank reason is red. | silencing a failing scenario: fix it or delete it | always |
